+def _plan_input_failure_reasons(value: Mapping[str, Any]) -> list[str]:
+    """Require an assessed original research channel, including a verified empty.
+
+    Channel owners already validate source/date/PIT identities. Their unknown
+    counts and partial assessments must not become a successful empty plan;
+    independent verified rows remain usable when another channel is missing.
